---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Resources
description: Who to call about city services, when trash and recycling are collected, and where to look up property and zoning in the Kennedy-King neighborhood.
heading: Resources
lead: Who to call, when things get collected, and where to look things up.
---
{% from "partials/macros.njk" import ext %}

{#- Everything on this page comes from _data/resources.yml -#}
{%- for group in resources %}
<section class="section{% if loop.index is even %} section--alt{% endif %}" aria-labelledby="res-{{ loop.index }}">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <h2 id="res-{{ loop.index }}">{{ group.section }}</h2>
        {% if group.intro %}<p>{{ group.intro }}</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid card-grid--2">
      {%- for item in group.items %}
      <article class="card">
        <h3>{% if item.url %}{{ ext(item.url, item.name) }}{% else %}{{ item.name }}{% endif %}</h3>
        <p>{{ item.summary }}</p>

        <dl class="details">
          {%- if item.phone %}
          <dt>Phone</dt>
          <dd><a href="{{ item.phone | telHref }}">{{ item.phone }}</a></dd>
          {%- endif %}
          {%- if item.address %}
          <dt>Address</dt>
          <dd>{{ item.address }}</dd>
          {%- endif %}
          {%- if item.hours %}
          <dt>Hours</dt>
          <dd>
            {%- for line in item.hours %}
            {{ line }}{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}
            {%- endfor %}
          </dd>
          {%- endif %}
        </dl>

        {%- if item.note %}
        <p class="card__meta">{{ item.note }} <a href="/events/#calendar">Community calendar</a></p>
        {%- endif %}
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endfor %}

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="missing-title">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="missing-title">Something missing?</h2>
    <p>If neighbors keep asking about something that isn't here, tell us and we'll add it. Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
